WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:15.061
Summer vacation starts tomorrow.

2
00:00:15.062 --> 00:00:20.559
My family has so many plans!

3
00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:26.060
We'll visit an amusement park.

4
00:00:26.061 --> 00:00:33.890
I'm going to ride a roller coaster. Whee!

5
00:00:33.891 --> 00:00:37.947
We'll visit a forest.

6
00:00:37.948 --> 00:00:44.397
I'm going to catch fish in the lake.

7
00:00:44.398 --> 00:00:49.712
We'll visit an island.

8
00:00:49.713 --> 00:00:54.194
I'm going to swim in the ocean.

9
00:00:54.195 --> 00:00:59.674
We'll visit a big city.

10
00:00:59.675 --> 00:01:05.059
I'm going to see a science museum.

11
00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:10.131
We'll visit an aquarium.

12
00:01:10.132 --> 00:01:16.234
I'm going to meet dolphins.

13
00:01:16.235 --> 00:01:20.322
We'll visit a water park.

14
00:01:20.323 --> 00:01:27.698
I'm going to ride a waterslide.

15
00:01:27.699 --> 00:01:31.485
I'm so excited!

16
00:01:31.486 --> 00:01:39.794
What will you do this summer?
